          "summary": "passages skips a malformed comment whose first word after claim or claims is a plain word and not a claim id.",
          "rationale": "The zero-trust review (D1) showed a note such as <!-- Claims below were reviewed in Q3 --> made index --changed refuse and every launcher --diff run inconclusive. The \\b start (D2) now also refuses ;, , and - near misses. tests/docs_test.go checks both lists.",
          "author": "fm/verilex-false-greens"
        }
